-- Restores evidence-candidate-a byte-for-byte to the snapshot taken seconds
-- before a UI round-trip test wrote an interview answer and a decision to it.
-- The UPDATE value is the exact original JSONB from that snapshot (evidence,
-- reviewer_edits = [], human_decision = null). This touches only this one
